          "index",
          "patients-family-html"
        ]
      },
      "evidence": "Block variant class 'icon' on .cards collides with the global .icon utility (styles/styles.css:381 display:inline-block;24x24). Block box computes 24x24; children overflow. Visible: letter-stacked rail text on /about-md-anderson + insomnia article; heading/band overlaps on /about-md-anderson/our-locations, /cancer-types/breast-cancer, /donors-volunteers; card-col overflow to 1679px at 1440; trio cards clipped at 390.",
      "fixability": "platform-migration",
      "recommendedMove": "Rename the variant (e.g. .cards.icon -> .cards.icon-cards) in blocks/cards/cards.css lines 201-206 AND in the 8 content instances, then republish; or scope the global utility to span.icon. Requires a code-branch commit — out of POC no-commit constraint.",
      "status": "fixed",
      "autofix": {
        "available": false,
        "target": "aem-eds",
        "strategy": null,
        "kind": null,
        "status": "unavailable",
        "appliedBy": null,
        "at": null,
        "detail": null
      },
      "resolvedBy": {
        "phase": "rollout",
        "at": "2026-08-20T06:34:16.692Z",
        "note": "Scoped the boilerplate .icon utility to span.icon/span.icon img (decorateIcons output) in styles/styles.css so .cards.icon block variants no longer collapse to 24x24. Also fixed three residues the collision masked: .cards.icon.trio cols now flex-shrink (was 1679px overflow on breast-cancer/clinical-trials), trailing full-width bands rule out-specifies the interior/blog column-2 rule (newsletter form ~80px bleed on insomnia/breast-center), mobile icon cards stack (51px bleed at 390), carousel gutter clipped at mobile (+12px). Re-shot all 12 pages at 1440+390: zero horizontal overflow, rails/trios/bands render per replica."
      },
      "firstSeenRun": "recorded"
    },
